import{_ as t,o,c as i,a2 as a}from"./chunks/framework.CqpfiAoK.js";const g=JSON.parse('{"title":"Entry 156 | Realm Refinement · World-Creation Realm | Predatory Faction vs. Symbiotic Faction","description":"","frontmatter":{"title":"Entry 156 | Realm Refinement · World-Creation Realm | Predatory Faction vs. Symbiotic Faction","no":156,"module":1,"tags":["Realm","World-Creation Realm","Predatory Faction","Symbiotic Faction","Path Comparison"],"related":["14-Unified Cultivation Realm Classification","04-Anti-Predation Core Treatise","05-Myriad Races Progress Basic Program"]},"headers":[],"relativePath":"en/0156_模块1-创世境-掠夺派vs共生派对比.md","filePath":"en/0156_模块1-创世境-掠夺派vs共生派对比.md"}'),n={name:"en/0156_模块1-创世境-掠夺派vs共生派对比.md"};function r(s,e,l,d,c,h){return o(),i("div",null,[...e[0]||(e[0]=[a('<h1 id="entry-156-world-creation-realm-predatory-faction-vs-symbiotic-faction-detailed-comparison" tabindex="-1">Entry 156 | World-Creation Realm: Predatory Faction vs. Symbiotic Faction Detailed Comparison <a class="header-anchor" href="#entry-156-world-creation-realm-predatory-faction-vs-symbiotic-faction-detailed-comparison" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Entry 156 | World-Creation Realm: Predatory Faction vs. Symbiotic Faction Detailed Comparison&quot;">​</a></h1><blockquote><p>Module: Module 1 · In-Depth Realm Refinement | Baseline references: Documents 14, 04, 05</p></blockquote><h2 id="introduction-god-kingdom-and-good-field-one-character-difference" tabindex="-1">Introduction: God-kingdom and good field, one character difference <a class="header-anchor" href="#introduction-god-kingdom-and-good-field-one-character-difference" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Introduction: God-kingdom and good field, one character difference&quot;">​</a></h2><p>The World-Creation Realm pushes the two civilizational paths&#39; divergence to the most tempting stage of &quot;creating worlds.&quot; Per the Unified Cultivation Realm Classification (Document 14), creation = creating a complete world containing life. When this task falls into the <strong>Predatory</strong> hand, it is building a god-kingdom for oneself; when it falls into the <strong>Symbiotic</strong> hand, it is reclaiming a good field for Myriad Races. This entry puts the two paths&#39; complete differences in the World-Creation Realm on the table.</p><p>The six top-level axioms running through the text are still the symbiotic faction&#39;s point-by-point counter-propositions to the predatory: the republican axiom of Myriad Races opposes &quot;beings in the god-kingdom are slaves&quot;; the collective ascension axiom opposes &quot;the creator god alone becoming a god&quot;; the anti-predation axiom opposes &quot;using creation to swallow stock&quot;; causal self-discipline and law-first oppose &quot;plot-style authoritarianism.&quot; Per Anti-Predation Core Treatise (Document 04) and Myriad Races Progress Basic Program (Document 05), unfolding the systematic comparison. Among them, Article 6 the universal equal infinite law establishes the origin logic that all beings inherently possess basic infinite power, and predation loses its meaning.</p><h2 id="i-overview-comparison-table" tabindex="-1">I. Overview Comparison Table <a class="header-anchor" href="#i-overview-comparison-table" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;I. Overview Comparison Table&quot;">​</a></h2><table tabindex="0"><thead><tr><th>Dimension</th><th>Predatory Creator</th><th>Symbiotic Creator</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>World nature</td><td>God-kingdom/back garden, privately owned by creator</td><td>Public world field, co-built by Myriad Races</td></tr><tr><td>Beings in world</td><td>Slaves, chives, NPCs, sole protagonist&#39;s foils</td><td>Life possessing equal evolutionary qualification</td></tr><tr><td>Law design</td><td>Designed around creator&#39;s privilege</td><td>Designed around beings&#39; welfare and self-consistency</td></tr><tr><td>Openness</td><td>Privately locked, outsiders forbidden</td><td>Open to Myriad Races, registered into joint contracting</td></tr><tr><td>Relation to existing cosmos</td><td>Often swallows and remodels existing planes</td><td>Pure-increment new construction, no causal disturbance</td></tr><tr><td>Ending</td><td>Creator&#39;s death = god-kingdom collapses</td><td>World runs perpetually, benefiting later generations</td></tr><tr><td>Mind requirement</td><td>None, the authoritarian takes all</td><td>Anti-predation stance + beings&#39; qualification review</td></tr></tbody></table><h2 id="ii-world-nature-god-kingdom-vs-good-field" tabindex="-1">II. World Nature: God-Kingdom vs. Good Field <a class="header-anchor" href="#ii-world-nature-god-kingdom-vs-good-field" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;II. World Nature: God-Kingdom vs. Good Field&quot;">​</a></h2><p>The Predatory&#39;s first motivation for creation is &quot;this world is mine to rule.&quot; Everything he designs in the world — laws, resources, beings — revolves around &quot;making me the sole master here.&quot; The world is his god-kingdom, he is the only true god.</p><p>The Symbiotic&#39;s first motivation for creation is &quot;Myriad Races need a new cultivation field.&quot; Everything he designs revolves around &quot;letting beings here evolve equally, freely, and sustainably.&quot; The world is a public good field, he is a tiller, not a landlord.</p><p>One judgment criterion suffices: after the creator god leaves, will this world continue to run healthily, or will it immediately collapse? The former is a good field, the latter a god-kingdom — a god-kingdom collapses without its god, a good field grows crops without its farmer.</p><h2 id="iii-beings-status-slaves-vs-masters" tabindex="-1">III. Beings&#39; Status: Slaves vs. Masters <a class="header-anchor" href="#iii-beings-status-slaves-vs-masters" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;III. Beings&#39; Status: Slaves vs. Masters&quot;">​</a></h2><p>In the Predatory world, beings are tools. Typical script: design a &quot;sole chosen protagonist,&quot; all other beings are foils, chives, cannon fodder; or design beings as forever obedient servants, stripping their evolutionary ceiling. This is trampling &quot;Myriad Races republicanism.&quot;</p><p>In the Symbiotic world, beings are their own masters. The world&#39;s substrate laws write equal evolutionary qualification, reserve autonomous space, letting beings develop civilization themselves and choose their own path. The creator god only backstops, not remote-controls.</p><h2 id="iv-resources-and-causality-swallowing-vs-increments" tabindex="-1">IV. Resources and Causality: Swallowing vs. Increments <a class="header-anchor" href="#iv-resources-and-causality-swallowing-vs-increments" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;IV. Resources and Causality: Swallowing vs. Increments&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Predatory creation often &quot;hangs a sheep&#39;s head but sells dog meat&quot;: nominally creating a new world, actually converting existing planes into private property, or draining this cosmos&#39; origin to infuse his own god-kingdom — essentially zero-sum predation.</p><p>Symbiotic creation is pure increment: using incremental resources in an isolated space to build a new world, not touching the home plane&#39;s stock, not disturbing existing causality. The world&#39;s existence enlarges the cosmos&#39; arable area, rather than being divided.</p><h2 id="v-openness-and-ending-private-locking-vs-perpetuity" tabindex="-1">V. Openness and Ending: Private Locking vs. Perpetuity <a class="header-anchor" href="#v-openness-and-ending-private-locking-vs-perpetuity" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;V. Openness and Ending: Private Locking vs. Perpetuity&quot;">​</a></h2><p>The Predatory&#39;s world is privately locked, outsiders forbidden, knowledge and technology monopolized within. Its ending is fragile: once the creator falls, the god-kingdom loses its维系, beings return to the sea of suffering.</p><p>The Symbiotic&#39;s world is open, blueprints and experiences network-shared. Its ending is perpetual: after the world is built it runs autonomously, the creator god promotes and leaves, the good field continues to benefit ten thousand generations. This is precisely the key to protagonist uniqueness dependence dropping from &quot;extremely high&quot; to &quot;extremely low&quot; — the world does not depend on any one god.</p><h2 id="vi-typical-ending-comparison" tabindex="-1">VI. Typical Ending Comparison <a class="header-anchor" href="#vi-typical-ending-comparison" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;VI. Typical Ending Comparison&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li>Predatory creator: beings prostrate in the god-kingdom, he enjoys momentary supremacy, ultimately the god-kingdom collapses in internal strife, rebellion, or his own fall</li><li>Symbiotic creator: the public world field flourishes, he himself step-by-step promotes to Origin, Multiverse, becoming a permanent node of the Myriad Races network</li></ul><h2 id="vii-five-core-takeaways" tabindex="-1">VII. Five Core Takeaways <a class="header-anchor" href="#vii-five-core-takeaways" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;VII. Five Core Takeaways&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li><strong>Universal infinite backstop</strong>: the universal equal infinite law establishes that every being inherently possesses basic infinite power; the easygoing have a guarantee, strivers and Youth Supremes can superimpose, predation naturally loses meaning</li><li><strong>Anti-energy waste</strong>: the Predatory wastes the cosmos&#39; scarcest &quot;world-design ability&quot; on building private-property god-kingdoms; the Symbiotic converts it into Myriad Races&#39; perpetual good fields</li><li><strong>Anti-predation</strong>: this entry&#39;s thesis — god-kingdom and good field, one private one public, two civilizational paths</li><li><strong>Tang-Luo upper limit comparison</strong>: Tang-Luo-style creators build a cosmos with themselves as the absolute protagonist; Heng Yuan Zhou creators build a public world where beings are equal</li><li><strong>Myriad Races full coverage</strong>: the symbiotic world defaults five-genealogy beings have paths; the predatory world has only one god and a flock of slaves</li><li><strong>Hyper-multiverse full openness</strong>: the symbiotic world&#39;s blueprints, ecology, and laws are fully open; the predatory god-kingdom is never open</li></ul><p>One often-overlooked difference must be added: the Predatory&#39;s god-kingdom is often &quot;built more and more closed,&quot; because it must prevent outsiders from entering to share power; the Symbiotic&#39;s good field is &quot;built more and more open,&quot; because it welcomes Myriad Races to till and live. Closed and open, seemingly just gate opening and closing, are actually two civilizations&#39; fundamental answer to &quot;whose is the world&quot; — the god-kingdom belongs to the god, the good field belongs to everyone willing to sow.</p><h2 id="conclusion" tabindex="-1">Conclusion <a class="header-anchor" href="#conclusion" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Conclusion&quot;">​</a></h2><p>The World-Creation Realm is the touchstone of &quot;the creator god&#39;s heart.&quot; The same world-creation ability, used to become a god or to till a field, determines whether one is predatory or symbiotic. A god-kingdom, however glorious, is only one person&#39;s stage; a good field, however plain, is the home of ten thousand generations of beings. Heng Yuan Zhou&#39;s choice is never &quot;whether you can create worlds,&quot; but &quot;whose world are you creating.&quot;</p><p>In the final analysis, the World-Creation Realm Predatory vs. Symbiotic comparison described in this document is no isolated case — always pointing toward the Anchor Symbiotic Civilization&#39;s co-building direction; its causality and energy-level traces are filed throughout in the Alaya Network, traceable and verifiable; law self-consistency is backstopped by the law-first axiom, not drifting with narrative convenience.</p><h2 id="related" tabindex="-1">Related <a class="header-anchor" href="#related" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Related&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li>Related documents: <a href="./14-修炼境界统一划分.html">14-Unified Cultivation Realm Classification</a> · <a href="./04-反掠夺主义核心论纲.html">04-Anti-Predation Core Treatise</a> · <a href="./05-万族共进基本纲领.html">05-Myriad Races Progress Basic Program</a> · <a href="./17-位面至高强者标准.html">17-Plane Transcendent Standard</a></li></ul>',30)])])}const m=t(n,[["render",r]]);export{g as __pageData,m as default};
